# Title: Referral Domains Filter
# Description: Blocks redirecting links; Malicious, advertising and privacy-invading sites.

!-/	Redirecting Links - Regex & Wildcard
||romaff*.com^$to=/romaff\d+\b/,reason=gambling-affiliate

!-/ Redirecting Links - Domains
||sivo.to^$reason=gambling-affiliate
||cutt.ly^$reason=gambling-affiliate
||shrgo.net^$reason=gambling-affiliate
||gshort.top^$reason=gambling-affiliate
||bsinplus.com^$reason=gambling-affiliate
||adj.st^$reason=tracking-shortlinks